            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>Lyla™ 2</strong> is designed to create a more dynamic and connected pleasure experience through its combination of <strong>versatile shape</strong>, <strong>remote control functionality</strong>, and <strong>SenseMotion™ technology</strong>. Its smooth oval form allows it to be used both externally and internally, making it suitable for different types of stimulation and more flexible exploration. This makes it an especially appealing choice for users who want one device that can adapt to different moods and preferences.</p><p>Its standout feature is the remote control, which lets users adjust vibrations with a simple tilt thanks to <strong>SenseMotion™ technology</strong>. Even more uniquely, the remote itself replicates the vibrations of the toy, allowing a partner to physically feel in their hand the same sensations being experienced. This creates a more interactive and immersive experience, especially for couples looking to explore shared pleasure in a more engaging way.{{ block.settings.page.title }}</p>{{ block.settings.page.content }}",
