        "collapsible_tab_PQya4J": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product information",
            "accordion_image": "shopify://shop_images/product-info-icon_a8db015b-ddf4-4acd-97f6-bcb1fc623814.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>Lyla™ 2</strong> is an advanced <strong>oval-shaped massager</strong> designed for both <strong>external and internal use</strong>. It includes a <strong>remote control</strong> with a range of up to <strong>12 meters</strong>, allowing users to manage vibration settings from a distance. The device also features <strong>SenseMotion™ technology</strong>, which makes it possible to control vibration intensity and patterns through movement of the remote. It can also be controlled directly from the toy itself, with or without the remote.</p><p>The updated Design Edition includes several improvements, including <strong>50% more power with less noise</strong>, an <strong>expanded remote control vibration range</strong>, and an <strong>intelligent memory chip</strong> designed to prevent vibration interruptions caused by environmental interference. Lyla™ 2 is also <strong>100% waterproof</strong>, <strong>rechargeable</strong>, and made with <strong>soft, delicate silicone</strong> for a more comfortable and body-safe feel. The package includes the <strong>Lyla™ 2 pleasure object</strong>, <strong>remote control</strong>, <strong>charger</strong>, <strong>2 AAA batteries</strong>, <strong>badge brooch</strong>, <strong>satin bag</strong>, and a <strong>1-year LELO warranty</strong>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_CDVNV9": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why you'll love it",
            "accordion_image": "shopify://shop_images/why-youll-love-it-icon_cfeb8990-ada5-4667-b824-aee5a0ca42cc.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>One of the standout qualities of <strong>Lyla™ 2</strong> is its ability to combine <strong>versatility, remote interactivity, and luxurious design</strong> in one elegant product. Its shape makes it suitable for different kinds of stimulation, while the motion-controlled remote adds a playful and intuitive layer that makes the experience feel more interactive and modern. The vibration feedback in the remote also makes it especially exciting for couples who want to feel more connected during play.</p><p>Its stronger performance, quieter motor, waterproof finish, and rechargeable design make it practical as well as pleasurable. Sleek, sophisticated, and full of thoughtful features, <strong>Lyla™ 2</strong> is an excellent choice for anyone looking for a premium pleasure device that offers freedom, flexibility, and a more immersive shared experience.</p>",
